{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1746086020\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OVERTHINKING IS A TRAP. LITERALLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planning ahead is smart \u2014 unless the game already planned for <i>that</i> plan. <br>Just wing it. The traps sure are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/9.gif?t=1746086020\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INVISIBLE? SOUNDS LIKE A YOU PROBLEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t see yourself, but don\u2019t worry \u2014 the spikes have excellent vision. Try not to blink while guessing where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/8.gif?t=1746086020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT\u2019S INSIDE? PROBABLY TOO MUCH \u2013 BUT LET\u2019S LIST IT ANYWAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly <strong>150 lovingly hand-crafted levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>200+ actual colors</strong> \u2013 no grayscale trickery here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics so beautiful</strong>, even your GPU cries a little</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gently unfair</strong> gameplay that respects you... kind of</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spikes that move. And watch. And judge.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret paths, hidden levels, and one totally not suspicious button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May increase your heart rate, but also <strong>your problem-solving IQ</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimal UI, maximal emotions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug? Or feature? You decide.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And yes... <strong>a few soft, squishy endings to make you feel things</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you've made it this far, you probably want to learn more about the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rule is simple: Spawn, die, respawn... and then do it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Download now and take your first step into the challenging world of Loom Path!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693920?t=1746086020","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/7252da64ab9cc221ed18a2834e97583f58da82e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746086020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/ecda77316a5bc2a2d1839686cdc4aac70038d4fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746086020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/ecda77316a5bc2a2d1839686cdc4aac70038d4fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746086020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1746086020\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OVERTHINKING IS A TRAP. LITERALLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planning ahead is smart \u2014 unless the game already planned for <i>that</i> plan. <br>Just wing it. The traps sure are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/9.gif?t=1746086020\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INVISIBLE? SOUNDS LIKE A YOU PROBLEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t see yourself, but don\u2019t worry \u2014 the spikes have excellent vision. Try not to blink while guessing where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/8.gif?t=1746086020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT\u2019S INSIDE? PROBABLY TOO MUCH \u2013 BUT LET\u2019S LIST IT ANYWAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly <strong>150 lovingly hand-crafted levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>200+ actual colors</strong> \u2013 no grayscale trickery here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics so beautiful</strong>, even your GPU cries a little</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gently unfair</strong> gameplay that respects you... kind of</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spikes that move. And watch. And judge.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret paths, hidden levels, and one totally not suspicious button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May increase your heart rate, but also <strong>your problem-solving IQ</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimal UI, maximal emotions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug? Or feature? You decide.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And yes... <strong>a few soft, squishy endings to make you feel things</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you've made it this far, you probably want to learn more about the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rule is simple: Spawn, die, respawn... and then do it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Download now and take your first step into the challenging world of Loom Path!</strong></i></p>","developers":["offsync"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/6b5a0060deb1bcf1ce6affe055de1f49ea7d244e/header.jpg?t=1746086020","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Trap Again","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["offsync"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/f0e1248aec6a9c0572c5faacb497ba6929b99647/ss_f0e1248aec6a9c0572c5faacb497ba6929b99647.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746086020","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/36939